  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your towering rage is awe-inspiring to behold.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Savage Surge<sup>ISC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you expend rounds of rage to gain a bonus on a performance combat check, you gain a bonus equal to the number of rounds of rage you expend, and the bonus applies for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1), rather than on a single performance check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
